                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "4472e4a7-996e-4484-b67b-b55efe75db6b",
                        "entry_id": "2692b6c4-646d-3c8d-ae58-5aeb287f16b3",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "indecisions"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "effb7c75-89e5-3335-afe1-32c6d9d83ed3",
                        "entry_id": "2692b6c4-646d-3c8d-ae58-5aeb287f16b3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The inability to decide on a course of action, especially if two or more possibilities exist."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a51dd6e7-04fd-4961-9198-7f3fb1decd5f",
                                "sense_id": "effb7c75-89e5-3335-afe1-32c6d9d83ed3",
                                "text": "Billy Toad has shown extreme indecision in all aspects when it comes to his jeep. Whether it's how to modify it, or if he will sell it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7836a240-b02c-4ad3-a772-e490a164148a",
                                "sense_id": "effb7c75-89e5-3335-afe1-32c6d9d83ed3",
                                "text": "There was no indecision or delay in the establishment of their relations; Rebecca's heart flew like an arrow to its mark, and her mind, meeting its superior, settled at once into an abiding attitude of respectful homage."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "522cf652-5d74-4c2d-ae6f-94e60794dbc4",
                                "sense_id": "effb7c75-89e5-3335-afe1-32c6d9d83ed3",
                                "text": "Moreover, in view of the lamentable present indecision of the Government in regard to electrification, the large-scale building of diesel power may prove to have been a farseeing move after all."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ed198b6f-7e7b-4bfb-b8d5-5366ead62f61",
                                "sense_id": "effb7c75-89e5-3335-afe1-32c6d9d83ed3",
                                "text": "I can't stand this indecision\nMarried with a lack of vision\nEverybody wants to rule the—"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
